    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google Sheets MCP Server Workflow — \n\n**The Problem it solves:** Manually opening Google Sheets to read data, update a row, or add new entries is a repetitive task that slows down any workflow — especially when it needs to happen every time an event occurs.\n\n**The Solution:** One MCP Server Trigger gives an AI agent direct control over Google Sheets — read existing rows, update a specific row, or append brand new data — all automatically, the moment a request comes in.\n\n**One line summary:** Your Google Sheets is now fully AI-controlled. Data gets logged, updated, and read automatically — no manual entry, ever.",
